      "filename": "Eighty Mile Beach, Western Australia (MODIS).jpg",
      "title": "File:Eighty Mile Beach, Western Australia (MODIS).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Eighty_Mile_Beach%2C_Western_Australia_%28MODIS%29.jpg",
